    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, what is our company's project management strategy to deliver The project on time and within budget? our project management strategy to deliver this project on time and within budget will utilize the Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public procurement. our company's will break down The project into five phases: Framing, Design, Pilot, Generalisation, and Run." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Each phase will end with a formal review and a go/no-go decision, ensuring that our company's are on track to meet the client's requirements and stay within budget. our company's will work in two-week sprints with demonstrable increments, allowing for flexibility and adaptability throughout The project. our company's dedicated team, consisting of a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will be responsible for delivering The project. our company's will also leverage our company's consortium partners, including OuraneCloud for sovereign cloud hosting, Ligeo Santé for health-IT integration, and a French public AI research laboratory for joint research on retrieval-augmented generation and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's past references in the public sector, including a regional council and a mutual health insurer, our company's are confident in our company's ability to deliver a successful project. our company's will work closely with the client through a joint steering committee, meeting monthly, and an operational committee, meeting fortnightly, to ensure that the client needs are met and that our company's are aligned throughout The project. our company's governance practices, including a single point of contact, a documented escalation path, and a RACI matrix, will ensure that roles and responsibilities are clear and that any issues are addressed promptly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

